1
00:00:02,690 --> 00:00:08,210
After midnight, the arcade on Ninth Street belonged to one boy, and one boy only.

2
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:12,392
RICO: Zoe! Zoe! I found it behind the claw machine. The golden token. The legend is REAL!

3
00:00:12,562 --> 00:00:16,878
ZOE: Rico, that thing costs fifty cents. I have three in my pocket.

4
00:00:19,886 --> 00:00:24,991
ARCADE OWNER: Kids, that token opens the old prize vault. Nobody has won it in twenty years.

5
00:00:25,161 --> 00:00:27,417
RICO: Twenty years? What happens if I lose it?

6
00:00:27,587 --> 00:00:30,061
ARCADE OWNER: Then Mr. Grimm buys this place by Friday.

7
00:00:32,637 --> 00:00:40,970
Rico slid the token into the slot. The vault groaned, the lights burst alive, and the whole arcade held its breath.

8
00:00:41,140 --> 00:00:45,313
RICO: Come on, come on... YES! Jackpot! Zoe, we saved the arcade!

9
00:00:45,483 --> 00:00:48,857
ZOE: One spin, one win. Okay, legend. Okay.
